### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@dockerUrl = http://order-service:8083
@contentType = application/json

### ─── READ ALL ORDERS ───
### Returns 5 seeded orders with various statuses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ ORDER BY ID ───
### Order 1: john_doe, Laptop Pro, COMPLETED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ ORDER BY ID ───
### Order 4: bob_wilson, CANCELLED (payment failed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/4
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ ORDER BY ID (non-existent) ───
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/999
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── CREATE ORDER ───
### Full orchestration: validates user, checks stock, processes payment, sends notification
### Prerequisites: user 1 and product 2 must exist
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 2,
  "quantity": 2
}

### ─── CREATE ORDER ───
### jane_smith (user 2) buys 1 USB-C Hub (product 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 2,
  "productId": 3,
  "quantity": 1
}

### ─── CREATE ORDER (insufficient stock) ───
### Attempt to buy 999 Wireless Mice — should fail stock validation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 2,
  "quantity": 999
}

### ─── CREATE ORDER (invalid user) ───
### Should fail user validation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 999,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1
}

### ─── MCP TOOL DISCOVERY (SSE) ───
GET {{baseUrl}}/mcp/sse
Accept: text/event-stream

### ─── HEALTH CHECK ───
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: {{contentType}}